{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CB8JBjvLF6UXoLNgUwiJ1r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the information I need. Let me conduct the Socratic analysis and create CLARITY_LOG.md. Let me identify all ambiguities systematically.\n\nNo src directory exists yet — this is a greenfield project with only pom.xml and config files.\n\nLet me now write the CLARITY_LOG.md with all rounds of Socratic Q&A.\n\nKey ambiguities I've identified:\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n1. Search endpoint - query parameter names and logic (AND vs OR)\n2. Validation error response structure - field-level detail format\n3. PUT semantics - full replace vs partial update (PATCH-like)\n\n\n4. Pagination response JSON structure - what key holds the employee list?\n5. POST/PUT/DELETE response codes and body\n6. Date/timestamp JSON serialization format\n7. Contradictory lambda guidance\n8. H2 SQL compatibility with PostgreSQL DDL\n\n**MAJOR:**\n9. Salary BigDecimal precision/scale\n10. CORS allowed origins\n11. Tomcat 7 plugin vs 8.5 confusion\n12. web.xml usage\n13. Email validation method\n14. Test data in test profile\n15. Search endpoint pagination support\n\nLet me work through thorough Socratic rounds for each of these ambiguities.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3261,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1410,"cache_read_input_tokens":40497,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1410},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1eb9e3f4-39b3-4e0b-beaa-33267b107dc8","uuid":"ebe48570-5bc4-4419-a1f0-58a240757894"}
